{"id":"d87c5d842ade903d","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md","title":"Smooth Map","display":"df-smooth-map — Smooth Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-smooth-map","aliases":["58-df-smooth-map","Smooth Map"],"display":"df-smooth-map — Smooth Map","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-atlas.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-smooth-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-smooth-map</span><span>Smooth Map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-smooth-map — Smooth Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"71fe0dc4c8613e69\" href=\"?note=71fe0dc4c8613e69\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md\">../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d530952583f9f96d\" href=\"?note=d530952583f9f96d\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-atlas.md\">../batch05/58-df-atlas.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,M,N,\\tau_M,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_M,\\mathcal A_N\\in V\">\\(F,M,N,\\tau_M,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_M,\\mathcal A_N\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\">\\(n,m\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EuclideanSmoothMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{EuclideanSmoothMap}_S\\)</span> 使用内部依赖；坐标卡编码为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\">\\(\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothMapStructure}_S(F,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,n,N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N,m)\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothMapStructure}_S(F,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,n,N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N,m)\\)</span> 固定一次调用中的两组光滑结构。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(F,M,N)\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(F,M,N)\\)</span> 保留原有存在结构式三参数接口。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothRealFunction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothRealFunction}_S\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^\\infty(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A;\\mathbb R)\">\\(C^\\infty(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A;\\mathbb R)\\)</span> 在下式给出，不依赖元语言光滑函数构造。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SmoothMapStructure}_S(F,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,n,N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N,m)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N,m)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(F,M,N)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\exists\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_M\\;\\exists\\langle V,Z,\\psi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_N\\;\\exists O\\in\\tau_M\\;\\Bigl(\np\\in O\\subseteq U\\land F[O]\\subseteq V\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{EuclideanSmoothMap}_S(\\{\\langle\\phi(x),\\psi(F(x))\\rangle:x\\in O\\},\\phi[O],n,m)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SmoothMapStructure}_S(F,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,n,N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N,m)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N,m)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(F,M,N)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\exists\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_M\\;\\exists\\langle V,Z,\\psi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_N\\;\\exists O\\in\\tau_M\\;\\Bigl(\np\\in O\\subseteq U\\land F[O]\\subseteq V\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{EuclideanSmoothMap}_S(\\{\\langle\\phi(x),\\psi(F(x))\\rangle:x\\in O\\},\\phi[O],n,m)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(F,M,N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists n,m\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\tau_M,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_M,\\mathcal A_N\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{SmoothMapStructure}_S(F,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,n,N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N,m).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(F,M,N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists n,m\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\tau_M,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_M,\\mathcal A_N\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{SmoothMapStructure}_S(F,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,n,N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N,m).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SmoothRealFunction}_S(f,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\land f\\in\\mathbb R^M\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A\\;\n\\mathrm{EuclideanSmoothMap}_S\\bigl(\\{\\langle\\phi(x),\\langle f(x)\\rangle\\rangle:x\\in U\\},W,n,1\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SmoothRealFunction}_S(f,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\land f\\in\\mathbb R^M\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A\\;\n\\mathrm{EuclideanSmoothMap}_S\\bigl(\\{\\langle\\phi(x),\\langle f(x)\\rangle\\rangle:x\\in U\\},W,n,1\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C^\\infty(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A;\\mathbb R)\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in\\mathbb R^M:\\exists n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\;\\mathrm{SmoothRealFunction}_S(f,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C^\\infty(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A;\\mathbb R)\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in\\mathbb R^M:\\exists n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\;\\mathrm{SmoothRealFunction}_S(f,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原有三参数的存在结构式接口未改为特定结构接口；新增结构显式关系供需要在多处复用同一结构的下游文件调用。</li>\n<li>实值函数在坐标中显式提升为一维向量值函数，避免把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R\">\\(\\mathbb R\\)</span> 与集合编码的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R^1\">\\(\\mathbb R^1\\)</span> 直接等同。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Lee, Introduction to Smooth Manifolds</li>\n<li>Warner, Foundations of Differentiable Manifolds</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"71fe0dc4c8613e69","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-atlas.md","status":"resolved","id":"d530952583f9f96d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-atlas.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","i